# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Maintenance & Cleanup:** Reduced Let’s Encrypt renewal frequency to avoid rate limits, removed deprecated logs and variables, applied broad refactorings, and merged the Matomo autosetup feature."
msgstr "**Priežiūra ir valymas:** Sumažinome kadrų atnaujinimo dažnį, kad išvengtume greičio ribų, pašalintume apleistas rąstų ir kintamųjų, taikytume plačius atrakcionus, ir sujungėme Matomo autosetup funkcija."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Major Changes**"
msgstr "**Pagrindiniai pakeitimai**"

msgid "**Major versions arrive with the image updates.** MariaDB moves from 12.3 to 13.0 and upgrades its system tables on start. Odoo moves from 19.0 to 20.0 and does not migrate an existing database across major versions on its own, so back up Odoo before you deploy. XWiki moves from 17.10 to 18.8, and the OpenLDAP base from Debian 12 to 13."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Manage Inventories Securely** Your inventories for running Infinito.Nexus MUST be managed in a separate repository and secured with tools such as [Ansible Vault](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Encryption) 🔒. Sensitive credentials MUST NEVER be stored in plaintext; use a password file to secure these details."
msgstr "**Tvarkyti atsargas saugiai** Jūsų atsargos paleidimui Infinito.Nexus PRIVALO būti valdomas atskiroje saugykloje ir apsaugotas tokiomis priemonėmis kaip: [Antarktinis slėnis](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Encryption) 🔒. Jautrūs duomenys NIEKADA neturi būti saugomi paprastu tekstu; naudokite slaptažodžio failą, kad apsaugotumėte šias detales."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Managed credentials:** The gateway master key and the admin UI password are generated and kept as role credentials, and the admin UI username is the platform administrator name."
msgstr "**Tvarkomi įgaliojimai:** Vartai Master raktas ir admin UI slaptažodis yra generuojami ir laikomi kaip role proximum, o admin UI naudotojo vardas yra platformos administratoriaus vardas."

# translated-by: libretranslate
