msgstr "**Modeliavimas:** nėra neprivalomų šaltinių praleidžiami, ne nepavyko, todėl tas pats vaidmuo veikia tiek savarankiškai pasirašytas ir Let 's šifravimo nustatymų."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Mode-selection trigger:** Membership in ``svc-swarm-node`` resolves ``DEPLOYMENT_MODE = swarm`` for every web-app role on that host."
msgstr "**Mode- atrankos gaidukas:** Narystė ``svc-swarm-node`` Išspręsti ``DEPLOYMENT_MODE = swarm`` kiekvienam web-app vaidmeniui tame mazge."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Mode-selection trigger:** Membership in `svc-swarm-node` resolves `DEPLOYMENT_MODE = swarm` for every web-app role on that host."
msgstr "**Mode- atrankos gaidukas:** Narystė `svc-swarm-node` Išspręsti `DEPLOYMENT_MODE = swarm` kiekvienam web-app vaidmeniui tame mazge."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Model and context:** ``agents.model`` names the gateway alias every agent runs on and defaults to the gateway’s chat model, so agents can run on a larger model than Open WebUI’s default. The context window of that alias comes from the model’s ``context`` in the inventory and is written into the agent config as Hermes ``model.context_length`` and OpenClaw ``contextWindow``. An agent prompt runs to tens of thousands of tokens, so a CPU-only local model spends minutes per turn on it; point ``agents.model`` at a remote model for interactive use. Hermes refuses a window below 64000 tokens and answers HTTP 500 on every prompt, so a platform whose minimum the selected alias misses is not offered at all: it is left out of ``/v1/models`` and answers 404, and the deploy says which platform it dropped and why. The rest of the broker keeps working, which is what makes a small model and OpenClaw a valid pairing. An alias that declares no window is reported instead of filtered, because an agent that does not know its window runs."
msgstr "**Modelis ir kontekstas:** ``agents.model`` vardai vartai slapyvardis kiekvienas agentas veikia ir įsipareigojimų neįvykdymo į vartai pokalbių modelį, todėl agentai gali paleisti didesnį modelį nei Open WebUINumatyta. To slapyvardžio konteksto langas ateina iš modelio ``context`` inventoriuje ir yra parašyta į agentas config kaip Hermes ``model.context_length`` ir OpenClaw ``contextWindow``. Agentas greitai veikia iki dešimčių tūkstančių žetonų, todėl CPU- tik vietinis modelis praleidžia minutes per posūkio jį; ``agents.model`` nuotolinio modelio interaktyviam naudojimui. Hermes atsisako lango apačioje 64000 žetonai ir atsakymai HTTP 500 kiekvieną skambutį, todėl platforma, kurios minimalus pasirinktas slapyvardis praleidžia nėra siūloma ne visi: ji yra palikta ``/v1/models`` ir atsakymai 404, ir dislokavimo sako, kokia platforma ji nukrito ir kodėl. Likusi brokerio vis dirba, kas daro mažą modelį ir OpenClaw tinkama porcija. Slapyvardis, kuris deklaruoja, kad langas nėra pranešta vietoj filtruoti, nes agentas, kuris nežino jo langas veikia."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Model and context:** `agents.model` names the gateway alias every agent runs on and defaults to the gateway's chat model, so agents can run on a larger model than Open WebUI's default. The context window of that alias comes from the model's `context` in the inventory and is written into the agent config as Hermes `model.context_length` and OpenClaw `contextWindow`. An agent prompt runs to tens of thousands of tokens, so a CPU-only local model spends minutes per turn on it; point `agents.model` at a remote model for interactive use. Hermes refuses a window below 64000 tokens and answers HTTP 500 on every prompt, so a platform whose minimum the selected alias misses is not offered at all: it is left out of `/v1/models` and answers 404, and the deploy says which platform it dropped and why. The rest of the broker keeps working, which is what makes a small model and OpenClaw a valid pairing. An alias that declares no window is reported instead of filtered, because an agent that does not know its window runs."
msgstr "**Modelis ir kontekstas:** `agents.model` vardai vartai slapyvardis kiekvienas agentas veikia ir įsipareigojimų neįvykdymo į vartai pokalbių modelį, todėl agentai gali paleisti didesnį modelį nei Open WebUINumatyta. To slapyvardžio konteksto langas ateina iš modelio `context` inventoriuje ir yra parašyta į agentas config kaip Hermes `model.context_length` ir OpenClaw `contextWindow`. Agentas greitai veikia iki dešimčių tūkstančių žetonų, todėl CPU- tik vietinis modelis praleidžia minutes per posūkio jį; `agents.model` nuotolinio modelio interaktyviam naudojimui. Hermes atsisako lango apačioje 64000 žetonai ir atsakymai HTTP 500 kiekvieną skambutį, todėl platforma, kurios minimalus pasirinktas slapyvardis praleidžia nėra siūloma ne visi: ji yra palikta `/v1/models` ir atsakymai 404, ir dislokavimo sako, kokia platforma ji nukrito ir kodėl. Likusi brokerio vis dirba, kas daro mažą modelį ir OpenClaw tinkama porcija. Slapyvardis, kuris deklaruoja, kad langas nėra pranešta vietoj filtruoti, nes agentas, kuris nežino jo langas veikia."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Model gateway key:** With the LiteLLM Gateway deployed, that gateway provisions a per-consumer virtual key aliased to this application."
msgstr "**Modelis vartai raktas:** Su LiteLLM Gateway dislokuotas, kad vartai suteikia vartotojams virtualus raktas atsilieka nuo šios programos."

msgid "**Model relay:** Agents call ``http://agent-broker:<port>/llm/v1`` with their own key; the broker forwards the call to LiteLLM with the broker’s virtual key, sets the OpenAI ``user`` field to the owner and logs a JSON ``relay`` event with owner, platform, path and upstream status. Only ``/v1/chat/completions`` and ``/v1/models`` are relayed; any other path answers 404 and logs a ``relay_refused`` event, so an agent cannot reach the gateway’s other routes with the broker’s key."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Model relay:** Agents call `http://agent-broker:<port>/llm/v1` with their own key; the broker forwards the call to LiteLLM with the broker's virtual key, sets the OpenAI `user` field to the owner and logs a JSON `relay` event with owner, platform, path and upstream status. Only `/v1/chat/completions` and `/v1/models` are relayed; any other path answers 404 and logs a `relay_refused` event, so an agent cannot reach the gateway's other routes with the broker's key."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Models go through the [052](052-llm-gateway-model-backends.md) gateway.** Each agent's BYO-model config points only at the `svc-ai-litellm` `/v1` + a model alias; it never addresses a provider directly. The Pis run no large models locally; heavy inference is routed to a GPU/external backend by the gateway."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Models via the [052](052-llm-gateway-model-backends.md) gateway; higher-level tools via [050](050-mcp-role-integration.md) MCP.** Embodiment changes the host boundary, not the model or tool planes: inference still goes through the gateway, and non-hardware tools still come via MCP."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Moderators from Keycloak:** With ``services.keycloak_adapter.enabled`` (on in variant 0), Jitsi’s ``TOKEN_AUTH_URL`` sends the “I am the host” step to the adapter. The adapter signs an HS256 JWT for every realm user; ``context.user.moderator`` is true only for members of the ``web-app-jitsi`` ``administrator`` group. Prosody’s ``token_affiliation`` module makes them owners and every other token holder a named member, and ``ENABLE_AUTO_OWNER=false`` keeps jicofo from promoting the first participant, so a non-moderator joins under their Keycloak name and waits in the lobby for a moderator."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Moderators from Keycloak:** With `services.keycloak_adapter.enabled` (on in variant 0), Jitsi's `TOKEN_AUTH_URL` sends the \"I am the host\" step to the adapter. The adapter signs an HS256 JWT for every realm user; `context.user.moderator` is true only for members of the `web-app-jitsi` `administrator` group. Prosody's `token_affiliation` module makes them owners and every other token holder a named member, and `ENABLE_AUTO_OWNER=false` keeps jicofo from promoting the first participant, so a non-moderator joins under their Keycloak name and waits in the lobby for a moderator."
msgstr ""

