# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Required addons are explicit, and install failure is gated by `required`.** Every addon carries a boolean `required` field (default `false`). Core components that are part of the deployed app contract, such as Odoo's core modules, use `required: true`: they are always installed, MAY omit `enabled`, and MUST NOT set `enabled: false`. The field also governs install-failure behaviour: when an addon's installation fails, a `required: true` addon MUST hard-fail the play (the deploy stops), while a `required: false` addon MUST only emit a warning, skip that addon, and let the play continue."
msgstr "**Reikalingi priedai yra aiškūs, ir įdiegti gedimas yra nustatyta `required`.** Kiekvienas addon neša boolean `required` laukas (numatytasis `false`). Pagrindiniai komponentai, kurie yra įdiegtos programos sutarties dalis, pavyzdžiui, Odoo pagrindiniai moduliai, naudoti `required: true`: jie visada įrengti, GEGUŽĖ praleisti `enabled`, ir NEGALIMA nustatyti `enabled: false`. Laukas taip pat reglamentuoja monta- gedimas elgesys: kai addon įrengimo nepavyksta, `required: true` addon PRIVALO sunkiai žaisti (išskleidimo stotelės), o `required: false` addon PRIVALO tik įspėjimą, praleisti, kad addon, ir tegul žaisti toliau."

