msgid "**`sys-stk-front-proxy/tasks/main.yml`** (one vhost per call): `:4-52` freezes domain, service key, ports, conf path (`lookup('nginx','files.domain')`), probe URL and accepted status codes; `:54-57` `sys-svc-nss`; `:59-61` `sys-stk-front-base`; `:63-69` `sys-front-tls` (letsencrypt or selfsigned, then `sys-svc-certs`); `:71-76` `sys-front-inj-all` (webserver core, cdn, inj-logout/dashboard/css/matomo/javascript); `:78-93` template choice (the role's own `templates/proxy.conf.j2`, else the basic vhost); `:95-109` vhost render with `notify: reload-openresty`; `:111-154` probe, restart decision and two `meta: flush_handlers`."
msgstr ""

msgid "**`sys-stk-full/tasks/main.yml`:** `:3-16` freezes the application context; `:18-28` includes front-proxy with `apply: delegate_to: groups['svc-prx-openresty'][0], run_once: true`, only when that group is non-empty; `:30-34` then includes backend."
