msgid "A client role discovers enabled shared server roles through the lookup, resolves the per-server credential, then connects server-to-server to each `/mcp` endpoint over Streamable HTTP. No candidate list is hard-coded and no browser-side fetch is involved."
msgstr "Kliento vaidmuo atranda įjungtas bendras serverio vaidmenis per peržiūros, išsprendžia per serverį pasitikėjimo, tada jungia serverį-to-serveris į kiekvieną `/mcp` vertinamoji baigtis, palyginti su supaprastinamu HTTP. Nė vienas kandidatų sąrašas nėra užkoduotas ir nėra rudųjų pusių."

msgid "A client that keeps an address past the set timeout (1h) without resolving it again loses direct egress for new connections to it: TCP goes through Tor and everything else is dropped. Flows already admitted keep their mark."
