msgid "A consumer reaches the gateway in one of three ways. Beside the gateway on the container network it names the gateway's service on its internal port; on the host itself it names a loopback address on the published port; on a host that runs no gateway of its own it names the gateway host's mesh address on the published port. Each mode admits exactly one shape, so a consumer that would send its prompts and its key anywhere else fails the deploy instead."
