# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A static-analysis pass (added in [tests/lint/ansible/roles/web-app/playwright/test_env_keys_used.py](../../tests/lint/ansible/roles/web-app/playwright/test_env_keys_used.py)) surfaced multiple roles that **declared** the `BIBER_*` env keys but never read them in the spec; the env file was prepared, the spec was never written. The most prominent example is `web-app-joomla`: it ships an OIDC variant (`plg_system_keycloak`) and an LDAP variant (core LDAP auth plugin) per [006 - Service-gated Playwright tests](README.md#archive), but the Playwright spec only exercises the admin login. A non-admin biber landing-page assertion is missing and would catch RBAC group-mapping drift introduced by 004."
msgstr "Name (pridėta [tests/lint/ansible/roles/web-app/playwright/test_env_keys_used.py](../../tests/lint/ansible/roles/web-app/playwright/test_env_keys_used.py)) įvyko keli vaidmenys, kurie **deklaruota** ir `BIBER_*` Env raktus, bet niekada skaityti juos spec; env failas buvo parengtas, ietis niekada nebuvo parašyta. Svarbiausias pavyzdys yra `web-app-joomla`: ji laivais OIDC variantas (`plg_system_keycloak`) ir LDAP variantas (pagrindinis LDAP auth įskiepis) per [006 - Service- sutvarkytas Playwright testai](README.md#archive), bet Playwright spec pratimai tik admin prisijungimo. Trūksta ne admin bior language patvirtinimas yra ir būtų sugauti RBAC grupės- kartografavimo dreifas pristatė 004."

msgid "A step reaches the next through ``nxt`` (one target) or ``branches`` (ordered ``(label, target)`` edges for a decision, ask or looping node); a terminal step has neither. ``fn`` is the node callable ``(state) -> state`` for a deterministic or decision step; a step without one compiles to a passthrough, which is also the stub a model node runs as in a unit test. A decision node writes its chosen branch label under its own id in the state; the router defaults to the first branch, so a stub run with empty state follows the forward path to a terminal. A decision may record itself through ``decide``, which writes the branch label and appends one audit record to the JSON Lines ledger the state names."
msgstr ""

