msgid "Allowed classifications are `native_server`, `native_client`, `native_both`, `plugin_server`, `sidecar_server`, `adapter_server`, `adapter_candidate`, `blocked`, `enabler`, `subordinate`, and `no_surface`. Allowed reasons MUST be documented and linted, including `no_remote_surface`, `host_execution_boundary`, `privileged_control_plane`, `shared_engine_isolation`, `administrative_surface`, `duplicate_owner`, `version_unverified`, `licence`, `hosted_only`, `stdio_only`, `interactive_browser_session`, `unreviewed_third_party`, and `missing_dependency`. A deployable mapping additionally carries the source URL and the exact supported version or commit; a negative classification carries a concrete reason and notes."
msgstr "Leistinos klasifikacijos: `native_server`, `native_client`, `native_both`, `plugin_server`, `sidecar_server`, `adapter_server`, `adapter_candidate`, `blocked`, `enabler`, `subordinate`, ir `no_surface`. Leistinos priežastys PRIVALO būti dokumentuotos ir susietos, įskaitant `no_remote_surface`, `host_execution_boundary`, `privileged_control_plane`, `shared_engine_isolation`, `administrative_surface`, `duplicate_owner`, `version_unverified`, `licence`, `hosted_only`, `stdio_only`, `interactive_browser_session`, `unreviewed_third_party`, ir `missing_dependency`. Naudojamas kartografavimas papildomai turi šaltinio URL ir tikslią palaikomą versiją arba įsipareigoti; neigiama klasifikacija turi konkrečią priežastį ir pastabas."

