msgid "Ansible forks a fresh worker process per task, so the in-process `_MERGED_APPLICATIONS_CACHE` and `_MERGED_USERS_CACHE` start empty in every worker. The constructor stage renders once and parks each payload plus its cache key in the host facts named by `APPLICATIONS_RENDERED_FACT` and `USERS_RENDERED_FACT`; every later worker inherits those facts at fork time and `get_merged_applications` / `get_merged_users` serve them instead of rendering. Ansible-free at import time like the rest of the package."
