msgid "Runner iteration routine: change the svc-runner role, gate on make test, deploy to a systemd host, and confirm the registered runner. One model step reads the deploy, the systemd status and the test-e2e-cli output; DinD proves the deploy structurally only. The relevant-delta decision skips a deploy nothing changed for, and a red deploy passes the red chain before the next inspect."
msgstr ""

