msgid "The `default:` resolves the inventory's central `API` mapping through the API lookup. Provider declarations live under `API_DECLARATIONS` in [group_vars/all/18_api.yml](../../../../../group_vars/all/18_api.yml). Keeping these mappings separate prevents playbook group variables from overwriting inventory credentials with empty values. The operator fills each provider once while the role keeps the shape the value must have."
