msgid "The private helpers (``_resolve_round_include`` and friends) are re-exported below because unit tests historically patch them under this package path. New tests SHOULD patch the submodule path directly (e.g. ``inventory.legacy_resolver._resolve_round_include``)."
msgstr "Privatūs pagalbininkai (``_resolve_round_include`` ir draugai) yra reeksportuojami žemiau, nes vieneto testai istoriškai pleistras juos pagal šį pakuotės kelią. Nauji bandymai GALIMA pleistras submodulio kelią tiesiogiai (pvz., ``inventory.legacy_resolver._resolve_round_include``)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The privileged `pull_request_target` build switches its **build source** from the base merge ref to the **raw PR head** (`head.repo.full_name` @ `head.sha`)."
msgstr "Privilegijuotieji `pull_request_target` kurti jungiklius **statyti šaltinį** nuo bazės susijungimas ref į **neapdorota PR galvutė** (`head.repo.full_name` @ `head.sha`)."

