msgstr "Šis vaidmuo sukviečia brokerio kartu su konteineriaisAPI lizdo prožektorius komponuoti ir sušilti dislokavimo. Open WebUI pasiekia brokerio kaip antrą OpenAI ryšį ir pirmyn skambinančiojo tapatybę. Tarpininkas tikrina skambinančiojo Keycloak grupė, kuria arba pradeda, kad skambinančiojo agentas pagal izoliavimo kilimo laikas, perduoti prašymą į jį ir sugrąžina atsakymą atgal. Agentai savo modelį pasiekia tik per tarpininką, kuris perduoda kiekvieną skambutį į bendrą LiteLLM vartus su savo raktu ir pažymi jį su savininku."

msgid "This role deploys the fixture with Docker Compose behind the standard front proxy, building a small custom nginx image from the tree under ``files/app``. The role refuses to run unless the inventory sets ``AGENT_FIXTURE_BUNDLE: true``; only the agents test bundle (``inventories/bundles/servers/agents``) sets that flag, so the fixture never comes up on a real host and any other inventory fails hard at the first task."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role deploys the fixture with Docker Compose behind the standard front proxy, building a small custom nginx image from the tree under `files/app`. The role refuses to run unless the inventory sets `AGENT_FIXTURE_BUNDLE: true`; only the agents test bundle (`inventories/bundles/servers/agents`) sets that flag, so the fixture never comes up on a real host and any other inventory fails hard at the first task."
msgstr ""

#, python-brace-format
msgid "This role deploys the official ``jitsi/{web,prosody,jicofo,jvb}`` images as a single-domain Jitsi Meet stack. With SSO enabled, the oauth2-proxy gate admits every realm user to the vhost. With ``services.keycloak_adapter.enabled`` also true, the role builds the `nordeck jitsi-keycloak-adapter <https://github.com/nordeck/jitsi-keycloak-adapter>`__ (Apache-2.0) and switches prosody to ``AUTH_TYPE=jwt``. In the LDAP-only variant, prosody uses the image’s own ``AUTH_TYPE=ldap`` path (``mod_auth_cyrus`` against the saslauthd the ``LDAP_*`` variables of `env.j2 <./templates/env.j2>`__ configure). The web container sits behind the central openresty reverse proxy at ``meet.{{ DOMAIN_PRIMARY }}``; the media plane (jvb) publishes UDP ``10000/udp`` on the host."
msgstr ""

#, python-brace-format
msgid "This role deploys the official `jitsi/{web,prosody,jicofo,jvb}` images as a single-domain Jitsi Meet stack. With SSO enabled, the oauth2-proxy gate admits every realm user to the vhost. With `services.keycloak_adapter.enabled` also true, the role builds the [nordeck jitsi-keycloak-adapter](https://github.com/nordeck/jitsi-keycloak-adapter) (Apache-2.0) and switches prosody to `AUTH_TYPE=jwt`. In the LDAP-only variant, prosody uses the image's own `AUTH_TYPE=ldap` path (`mod_auth_cyrus` against the saslauthd the `LDAP_*` variables of [env.j2](./templates/env.j2) configure). The web container sits behind the central openresty reverse proxy at `meet.{{ DOMAIN_PRIMARY }}`; the media plane (jvb) publishes UDP `10000/udp` on the host."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role deploys the single-node Wazuh stack (``wazuh.manager``, ``wazuh.indexer``, ``wazuh.dashboard``) with Docker Compose or Docker Swarm. A one-shot ``wazuh-certs-generator`` job creates the internal TLS material before the manager and the indexer start. The indexer is the stack’s own datastore and holds the OpenSearch security configuration, so the role needs no shared database. Agent enrollment is not part of this role: the agent ports are declared in `services.yml <./meta/services.yml>`__ but not published. The manager’s vulnerability detection data (``/var/ossec/queue/vd``, volume ``wazuh_manager_vd``) is deliberately not backed up. The manager downloads it again after a restore, which can take a long time. This matters once agents are enrolled."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role deploys the single-node Wazuh stack (`wazuh.manager`, `wazuh.indexer`, `wazuh.dashboard`) with Docker Compose or Docker Swarm. A one-shot `wazuh-certs-generator` job creates the internal TLS material before the manager and the indexer start. The indexer is the stack's own datastore and holds the OpenSearch security configuration, so the role needs no shared database. Agent enrollment is not part of this role: the agent ports are declared in [services.yml](./meta/services.yml) but not published. The manager's vulnerability detection data (`/var/ossec/queue/vd`, volume `wazuh_manager_vd`) is deliberately not backed up. The manager downloads it again after a restore, which can take a long time. This matters once agents are enrolled."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role deploys the upstream render server image, which serves the editor at `/` and the render queue at `/renders/`. The server puts everything except its login page behind its own login form. When Keycloak is part of the deployment, the oauth2 gate additionally guards the whole domain, so only signed-in platform users reach that form."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role deploys the upstream render server image, which serves the editor at ``/`` and the render queue at ``/renders/``. The server puts everything except its login page behind its own login form. When Keycloak is part of the deployment, the oauth2 gate additionally guards the whole domain, so only signed-in platform users reach that form."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role detects unused **anonymous Docker volumes** that are not bound to any running container."
msgstr "Šis vaidmuo aptinka nenaudojamas **anoniminiai Docker tomai** kurie nėra sujungti su jokia važiuokle."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role detects unused **anonymous Docker volumes** that are not bound to any running container.   It can optionally exclude specific volumes from the check using a configurable whitelist."
msgstr "Šis vaidmuo aptinka nenaudojamas **anoniminiai Docker tomai** kurie nėra sujungti su jokia važiuokle. Jis gali pasirinktinai pašalinti tam tikrus tomus iš patikrinimo naudojant konfigūruojamą baltąjį."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role disk-space usage monitor; alerts when usage exceeds threshold."
msgstr "Šis vaidmuo disko- erdvės naudojimo stebėjimo; perspėjimai, kai naudojimas viršija slenkstį."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role does **not** sign leaf certificates. It only provisions the Root CA."
msgstr "Šis vaidmuo **nėra** pasirašyti lapų sertifikatus. Tai taikoma tik pagrindinei CA."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role does NOT configure OIDC against ``web-app-keycloak``, LDAP against ``svc-db-openldap``, or any role-claim / LDAP-group RBAC mapping. Bridgy Fed authenticates users via their fediverse or atproto credentials at the source platform, not via local accounts. There is no local user table to bind an external IdP to, and no in-app authorisation tier to map a Keycloak role or LDAP group onto. Placing Bridgy Fed behind ``web-app-keycloak``\\ ’s SSO-proxy sidecar would break inbound federation traffic and MUST NOT be done. This SSO and RBAC exception is documented per `lifecycle.md <../../docs/contributing/design/role/services/lifecycle.md>`__."
msgstr "Šis vaidmuo neturi konfigūruoti OIDC prieš ``web-app-keycloak``, LDAP prieš ``svc-db-openldap``, arba bet koks role- pretension / LDAP- group RBAC kartografavimas. Bridžas Fed autorizuoja vartotojus per jų fedisheterogenišką ar atproto požymių šaltinio platforma, o ne per vietos sąskaitas. Nėra vietinio vartotojo stalo, kuris pririštų išorinį IPP prie, ir nėra in- app leidimų pakopos, kad būtų galima sudaryti žemėlapį Keycloak vaidmuo arba LDAP grupė. Vieta Bridgy Fed už ``web-app-keycloak``\\ s SSO- proxy sidecar būtų nutraukti į federacijos eismą ir neturi būti daroma. Ši SSO ir RBAC išimtis yra dokumentuojama pagal `lifecycle.md <../../docs/contributing/design/role/services/lifecycle.md>`__."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role does NOT configure OIDC against `web-app-keycloak`, LDAP against `svc-db-openldap`, or any role-claim / LDAP-group RBAC mapping. Bridgy Fed authenticates users via their fediverse or atproto credentials at the source platform, not via local accounts. There is no local user table to bind an external IdP to, and no in-app authorisation tier to map a Keycloak role or LDAP group onto. Placing Bridgy Fed behind `web-app-keycloak`'s SSO-proxy sidecar would break inbound federation traffic and MUST NOT be done. This SSO and RBAC exception is documented per [lifecycle.md](../../docs/contributing/design/role/services/lifecycle.md)."
msgstr "Šis vaidmuo neturi konfigūruoti OIDC prieš `web-app-keycloak`, LDAP prieš `svc-db-openldap`, arba bet koks role- pretension / LDAP- group RBAC kartografavimas. Bridžas Fed autorizuoja vartotojus per jų fedisheterogenišką ar atproto požymių šaltinio platforma, o ne per vietos sąskaitas. Nėra vietinio vartotojo stalo, kuris pririštų išorinį IPP prie, ir nėra in- app leidimų pakopos, kad būtų galima sudaryti žemėlapį Keycloak vaidmuo arba LDAP grupė. Vieta Bridgy Fed už `web-app-keycloak`SSO- proxy sidecar būtų nutraukti į federacijos eismo ir neturi būti padaryta. Ši SSO ir RBAC išimtis yra dokumentuojama pagal [lifecycle.md](../../docs/contributing/design/role/services/lifecycle.md)."

msgid "This role does not configure OIDC against ``web-app-keycloak`` or LDAP against ``svc-db-openldap``. atmo has no local accounts: users sign in with AT Protocol OAuth at their own PDS, and the PDS of ``web-app-bluesky`` is where the platform’s accounts live. Moderation rights are granted to DIDs listed in ``services.atmo.moderator_dids``, not to an in-app role, so there is no Keycloak group to map either. Placing atmo behind the SSO proxy would break the OAuth callbacks and the public client metadata the PDS fetches."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role does not configure OIDC against `web-app-keycloak` or LDAP against `svc-db-openldap`. atmo has no local accounts: users sign in with AT Protocol OAuth at their own PDS, and the PDS of `web-app-bluesky` is where the platform's accounts live. Moderation rights are granted to DIDs listed in `services.atmo.moderator_dids`, not to an in-app role, so there is no Keycloak group to map either. Placing atmo behind the SSO proxy would break the OAuth callbacks and the public client metadata the PDS fetches."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role enhances your NGINX configuration by conditionally injecting global Matomo tracking and theming elements into your HTML responses. It uses NGINX sub-filters to seamlessly add tracking scripts and CSS links to your web pages."
msgstr "Šis vaidmuo sustiprina jūsų NGINX konfigūraciją, sąlyginai leisdamas globalias Matomo stebėti ir teminius elementus į savo HTML atsakymus. Jis naudoja NGINX subfiltrus, kad sklandžiai pridėtų sekančius scenarijus ir CSS nuorodas į jūsų puslapius."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role ensures OpenSSL is installed once as a shared host dependency for roles that invoke the ``openssl`` CLI."
msgstr "Šis vaidmuo užtikrina OpenSSL yra įdiegta vieną kartą kaip bendra šeimininko priklausomybę vaidmenis, kurie remiasi ``openssl`` CLI."

