msgid "This role is the **shared Playwright runner** for all end-to-end tests in the repository. Changes here affect every application role that uses it."
msgstr "Šis vaidmuo yra **bendrinamas grojaraščio bėgikas** visų galutinių bandymų saugykloje. Pakeitimai čia turi įtakos kiekvieną taikymo vaidmenį, kad jį naudoja."

msgid "This role is the single place Infinito.Nexus sets kernel parameters. Each caller passes ``sys_sysctl_owner`` and a ``sys_sysctl_parameters`` dictionary; the role persists them in ``/etc/sysctl.d/99-<owner>.conf`` and applies them at once. The constructor stage calls it with the owner ``host`` and ``SYS_SYSCTL_PARAMETERS``, the host-wide option an inventory MAY override. Its default entry is ``kernel.core_pattern``: the systemd-coredump pipe where ``/usr/lib/systemd/systemd-coredump`` exists, and otherwise a file pattern in a dedicated root-owned directory under ``/var/lib/infinito``."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role is the single place Infinito.Nexus sets kernel parameters. Each caller passes `sys_sysctl_owner` and a `sys_sysctl_parameters` dictionary; the role persists them in `/etc/sysctl.d/99-<owner>.conf` and applies them at once. The constructor stage calls it with the owner `host` and `SYS_SYSCTL_PARAMETERS`, the host-wide option an inventory MAY override. Its default entry is `kernel.core_pattern`: the systemd-coredump pipe where `/usr/lib/systemd/systemd-coredump` exists, and otherwise a file pattern in a dedicated root-owned directory under `/var/lib/infinito`."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role is the single point of truth for the release pins of the lint tools that the toolchain installs from GitHub releases: [actionlint](https://github.com/rhysd/actionlint), [hadolint](https://github.com/hadolint/hadolint) and [shfmt](https://github.com/mvdan/sh)."
msgstr "Šis vaidmuo yra vienas iš tiesos taškas išleidimo smeigtukai iš lintų įrankių, kad įrankių grandinė įdiegia iš GitHub spaudai: [actilintas](https://github.com/rhysd/actionlint), [hadolintas](https://github.com/hadolint/hadolint) ir [shfmt](https://github.com/mvdan/sh)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role is the single point of truth for the release pins of the lint tools that the toolchain installs from GitHub releases: `actionlint <https://github.com/rhysd/actionlint>`__, `hadolint <https://github.com/hadolint/hadolint>`__ and `shfmt <https://github.com/mvdan/sh>`__."
msgstr "Šis vaidmuo yra vienas iš tiesos taškas išleidimo smeigtukai iš lintų įrankių, kad įrankių grandinė įdiegia iš GitHub spaudai: `actionlint <https://github.com/rhysd/actionlint>`__, `hadolint <https://github.com/hadolint/hadolint>`__ ir `shfmt <https://github.com/mvdan/sh>`__."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role letsEncrypt TLS provider for sys-front-tls. Ensures certificate presence."
msgstr "Šis vaidmuo letsEncrypt TLS teikėjas sys-front-tls. Užtikrina sertifikato buvimą."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role manages GNOME Shell extensions by ensuring user extensions are enabled and by installing the CLI GNOME Extension Manager. The CLI tool facilitates the configuration and control of GNOME extensions via the command line."
msgstr "Šis vaidmuo valdo GNOME Shell plėtiniai užtikrinant, kad vartotojai plėtiniai yra įjungti ir diegiant CLI GNOME plėtinių tvarkyklę. CLI įrankis palengvina GNOME plėtinių konfigūraciją ir kontrolę per komandų eilutę."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role manages the generation and handling of an SSH key for the [root user](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Superuser) on a target system. It ensures that an SSH key is generated if one does not already exist and outputs the public key, enabling secure SSH access for the root user in automated environments."
msgstr "Šis vaidmuo valdo SSH rakto gamybos ir tvarkymo [šaknies naudotojas](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Superuser) dėl tikslinės sistemos. Ji užtikrina, kad SSH klavišas būtų generuojamas, jei jis dar neegzistuoja ir išveda viešąjį raktą, kuris užtikrina saugų SSH priėjimą šakniniam naudotojui automatizuotoje aplinkoje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role manages the generation and handling of an SSH key for the `root user <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Superuser>`__ on a target system. It ensures that an SSH key is generated if one does not already exist and outputs the public key, enabling secure SSH access for the root user in automated environments."
msgstr "Šis vaidmuo valdo SSH rakto gamybos ir tvarkymo `root user <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Superuser>`__ dėl tikslinės sistemos. Ji užtikrina, kad SSH klavišas būtų generuojamas, jei jis dar neegzistuoja ir išveda viešąjį raktą, kuris užtikrina saugų SSH priėjimą šakniniam naudotojui automatizuotoje aplinkoje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role monitors the health status of Docker containers on the system. It detects containers that are either **unhealthy** or have **exited with a non-zero code**, and triggers alerts if issues are found."
msgstr "Šis vaidmuo stebėti sveikatos būklę Docker konteineriai sistemoje. Jis aptinka konteinerius, kurie yra arba **nesveika** arba **yra su nuliniu kodu**ir sukelia perspėjimus, jei nustatoma problemų."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role no longer ships its own local recording wrapper."
msgstr "Šis vaidmuo nebėra laivai savo vietos įrašymo įvyniojimas."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role now supports OpenID Connect (OIDC) authentication with [Mailu-OIDC](https://github.com/heviat/Mailu-OIDC)! 🎉"
msgstr "Šis vaidmuo dabar palaiko OpenID Connect (OIDC) tapatumo nustatymas [Mailu- OIDC](https://github.com/heviat/Mailu-OIDC)! 🎉"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role optimizes storage allocation for Docker volumes by migrating volumes between SSD (rapid storage) and HDD (mass storage) based on container image types. It creates symbolic links to maintain consistent storage paths after migration."
msgstr "Šis vaidmuo optimizuoja atsargų paskirstymą Docker tomams, perkeldamas apimtis tarp SMD (greitas sandėliavimas) ir HDD (masės saugojimas) remiantis konteinerių vaizdo tipais. Ji sukuria simbolines nuorodas, kad po perėjimo būtų išlaikyti nuoseklūs saugojimo keliai."

msgid "This role owns the ``design`` service flag and the corporate design configuration (``services.design.colors``, ``services.design.font``), and declares ``web-svc-cdn`` as the upstream that serves the actual CSS bytes. Consumer roles gate design-dependent surfaces on ``'web-svc-design' in group_names`` via their own ``meta/services.yml``. An enabled ``design`` flag injects the shared CSS and activates the JavaScript injection of the consumer; ``javascript`` stays independently switchable. The role’s canonical domain 301-redirects to the CDN’s canonical domain so health probes against the design hostname return a valid response."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role owns the `design` service flag and the corporate design configuration (`services.design.colors`, `services.design.font`), and declares `web-svc-cdn` as the upstream that serves the actual CSS bytes. Consumer roles gate design-dependent surfaces on `'web-svc-design' in group_names` via their own `meta/services.yml`. An enabled `design` flag injects the shared CSS and activates the JavaScript injection of the consumer; `javascript` stays independently switchable. The role's canonical domain 301-redirects to the CDN's canonical domain so health probes against the design hostname return a valid response."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role performs a complete cleanup of Docker resources by invoking a systemd-managed script. It removes unused Docker images, stopped containers, networks, build cache, and anonymous volumes. The cleanup is fully automated and can run on a schedule or be triggered manually."
msgstr "Šis vaidmuo atlieka visiškai išvalyti Docker išteklių naudojant sistemiškai valdomą scenarijų. Jis pašalina nepanaudotus Docker vaizdus, sustabdė konteinerius, tinklus, sukurti talpyklas ir anoniminius tomus. Valymas yra visiškai automatizuotas ir gali vykti pagal tvarkaraštį arba būti įjungtas rankiniu būdu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role provides a **unified mail setup** for your hosts:"
msgstr "Šis vaidmuo suteikia **unifikuota pašto sąranka** Jūsų šeimininkams:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role provides a comprehensive Dockerized environment for running Akaunting. It deploys the Akaunting application alongside a MariaDB database, configures environment variables, and integrates with NGINX as a reverse proxy. This setup is ideal for both production and development environments."
msgstr "Šis vaidmuo suteikia išsamią dokumentuotą aplinką veikia AkauntingJi dislokuoja Akaunting Taikymas kartu su MariaDB duomenų bazė, nustato aplinkos kintamuosius ir integruoja su NGINX kaip atvirkštinį rodiklį. Ši konfigūracija idealiai tinka tiek gamybos, tiek plėtros aplinkai."

msgid "This role provides a fully automated deployment of [BigBlueButton](https://bigbluebutton.org/) using Docker Compose on Arch Linux. It manages the entire lifecycle of the deployment, from cloning the upstream Docker repository and generating the `.env` configuration to customizing `compose.yml` for volume usage, WebSocket proxying, and optional OIDC integration. The setup includes conditional Greenlight activation, WebRTC support via TURN/STUN, and various fixes for known container orchestration issues. The role is modular and integrates seamlessly with the Infinito.Nexus infrastructure, including reverse proxy configuration, domain management, and secrets templating. By default, BigBlueButton is deployed with best-practice hardening, modular secrets, and support for multiple authentication methods and scalable storage backends."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role provides a fully automated deployment of `BigBlueButton <https://bigbluebutton.org/>`__ using Docker Compose on Arch Linux. It manages the entire lifecycle of the deployment, from cloning the upstream Docker repository and generating the ``.env`` configuration to customizing ``compose.yml`` for volume usage, WebSocket proxying, and optional OIDC integration. The setup includes conditional Greenlight activation, WebRTC support via TURN/STUN, and various fixes for known container orchestration issues. The role is modular and integrates seamlessly with the Infinito.Nexus infrastructure, including reverse proxy configuration, domain management, and secrets templating. By default, BigBlueButton is deployed with best-practice hardening, modular secrets, and support for multiple authentication methods and scalable storage backends."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role provides a locking mechanism that delays maintenance activities such as updates, backups, or patch applications while conflicting services run. It waits for the specified services to stop, up to a timeout."
msgstr ""

