# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Walk a (possibly nested) credentials schema and emit one vault block per scalar leaf into ``dest_node``. Nested dicts (e.g. ``secrets.credentials.recaptcha = {key, secret}``) recurse into nested CommentedMaps so each leaf becomes its own vault-encrypted entry instead of being collapsed via ``str(dict)`` into a Python-repr blob (the regression that broke run 26428080957 jobs 77797371397 and 77797371442 for web-app-espocrm and web-app-listmonk)."
msgstr "Eiti a (galbūt stested) galiojimo schema ir išskiria vieną saugyklos bloką per skaliarinio lapų ``dest_node``. Neišpjauti diskai (pvz., ``secrets.credentials.recaptcha = {key, secret}``) rekurse į įdėtas CommentedMaps todėl kiekvienas lapas tampa savo Vault- šifruotas įrašas, o ne sugriuvo per ``str(dict)`` į Python- repr blob (nulūžusi regresija 26428080957 darbo vietos 77797371397 ir 77797371442 yra web-app-espocrm ir web-app-listmonk)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
