msgid "`Grafana <https://grafana.com/oss/grafana/>`__ is the window onto the complete logs of every deployed application, stored in `Loki <../web-svc-loki/README.md>`__, and onto the metrics of `Prometheus <../web-app-prometheus/README.md>`__. Operators and auditors search, graph and alert on any application’s logs without a shell on the host."
msgstr ""

msgid "`Grafana Loki <https://grafana.com/oss/loki/>`__ is the full-log store of the platform. It keeps every log line of every deployed application for search, graphs and alerts in `Grafana <../web-app-grafana/README.md>`__; security alerting stays with `Wazuh <../web-app-wazuh/README.md>`__."
msgstr ""

msgid "`HERMES_DASHBOARD_BASIC_AUTH_USERNAME` carries the administrator username and `HERMES_DASHBOARD_BASIC_AUTH_PASSWORD` the generated credential `secrets.credentials.webui_password` of this role. Both are rendered in every deployment: the dashboard refuses to bind to a non-loopback address while no auth provider is registered, and without them the container port never listens."
