# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "```svc-ai-litellm`` <../svc-ai-litellm/>`__ publishes one routing alias. When this service is deployed, the gateway’s pre-call hook asks it which of the eligible models should answer, passing the prompt as the state and the surviving aliases as the options of a single ``choice`` question. ``services.litellm.router.strategy`` follows ``services.s1.enabled``, so deploying this role is what switches the gateway from a weighted score to a System One decision."
msgstr "```svc-ai-litellm`` <../svc-ai-litellm/>`__ publishes one routing alias. When this service is deployed, the gateway’s pre-call hook asks it which of the eligible models should answer, passing the prompt as the state and the surviving aliases as the options of a single ``choice`` question. ``services.litellm.router.strategy`` follows ``services.s1.enabled``, todėl dislokuoti šį vaidmenį yra tai, kas perjungia vartus iš svertinio rezultatas į System One sprendimas."

