# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``ansible`` (default) wraps `matrix-docker-ansible-deploy <https://github.com/spantaleev/matrix-docker-ansible-deploy>`__ (MDAD). MDAD runs ~70 upstream sub-roles to deliver Synapse, Element, every supported bridge, Element Call, and Jitsi. Infinito.Nexus pins MDAD by commit, renders an MDAD inventory from ``services.matrix.*`` knobs, and disables MDAD’s bundled Traefik / Postgres / Redis so the central Infinito services back the stack."
msgstr "``ansible`` (numatytasis) įvynioti `matrix-docker-ansible-deploy <https://github.com/spantaleev/matrix-docker-ansible-deploy>`__ (MDAD). MDAD veikia ~70 prieš subvaidmenis pristatyti Synapse, Elementas, kiekvienas remiamas tiltas, Elementas Skambutis, ir Jitsi. Infinito.Nexus smeigtukai MDAD pagal įsipareigojimą, daro MDAD inventorių iš ``services.matrix.*`` mygtukus, ir išjungia MDAD paketas Traefk / Postgres / Redis Taigi centrinis Infinito paslaugos atgal kamino."

