msgid "`tasks/01_setup.yml` line 80 hands `DECIDIM_ADMIN_PASSWORD` to `container exec` as `-e NAME=value` in argv (read from the task file, not measured on a stack). Options: feed the value through stdin next to the script, as `tasks/03_design.yml` does with its payload, or through an env file."
