msgid "`templates/playwright.env.j2` acts as the stable marker for discovery and as the source of environment configuration."
msgstr "`templates/playwright.env.j2` veikia kaip stabilus aptikimo žymuo ir kaip aplinkos konfigūracijos šaltinis."

msgid "`templates/playwright.env.j2` blocks the administrator persona with the reason that the account has no password. Without SSO and LDAP the role now sets one. Options: unblock the persona for that case and teach the admin flow the native sign-in form, or keep the block and reword its reason."
msgstr ""

msgid "`templates/playwright.env.j2` still blocks the administrator and biber persona flows with the rationale that the role provisions no Pretix account; `tasks/utils/administrator.yml` now converges a native administrator with the `users` e-mail while `sso` is off, and pretix-oidc grants staff from the RBAC administrator group while it is on, so the administrator flow could be enabled."
