msgstr ""

msgid "`templates/xml/user/xwikiusers_object.xml.j2` has the same shape, so first name, last name, email and `active` of the administrator are not stored (measured: `first_name` empty). Options: write the properties as `<property name=\"...\"><value>...</value></property>` directly below `<object>`, and update an existing object with a `PUT` on the object."
