msgid "`test-oidc-login.js` and `test-guest.js` in each agent's `files/playwright/`"
msgstr "`test-oidc-login.js` ir `test-guest.js` kiekvieno agento `files/playwright/`"

msgid "`test-rbac-profile.js` checks the admin flag of the administrator and of biber through the Synapse admin API, and checks that an OIDC login of biber overwrites a stale display name and has bound biber's email."
